<!-- wp:details {"className":"ifm-readmore"} -->
<details class="wp-block-details ifm-readmore"><summary>Read more</summary><!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Looking after a site means doing the dull things in the right order. Back up. Update. Check the pages and the forms still work. Keep an eye on whether the site is up. When something does break, find the cause, so the same fault does not return next week.</p>
